corner_radius_bottom_left = 26

; [rootwood-canopy] Rootwood brown and gold vines. The cabinet used to be an
; OrnateFrame (carved mossy stone), then a plain plum Panel (slot ui phase 3);
; it is a plain rootwood-brown Panel now (Tuning.C_ROOTWOOD), and the vine
; border is still the item card's own nine-patch (card_frame.png), not new art.
;
; The vines hang off ReelGrid rather than Cabinet so they draw OVER the reel
; windows' edges, as the board's frame does. ReelGrid is sized to the reel window
; by slot_machine.apply_height(), and the offsets below grow the frame outward by
; the cabinet's own margin (34 across, 36 down) so its outer edge meets the
; cabinet's. Same half-thickness trick as item_card.tscn, at 0.4 instead of 0.5:
; anchors of 1/0.4 = 2.5 and offsets of 5x the margin, so the 75 px band draws
; as 30 px with all of its art still in it.

